/T (Prabandhan is the annual management conclave organized by the Department of Management Sciences \(DoMS\), IIT Kanpur. It aims to provide students with an engaging platform to exhibit and strengthen their managerial competencies through a diverse array of events. In addition to nationally recognized case competitions, the conclave hosts high-impact seminars, CXO-level panel discussions, and expert-led sessions exploring pressing industry themes. Through its multifaceted approach, Prabandhan equips students not only to demonstrate their skills but also to connect meaningfully with emerging trends in the field of management.)
